**Marker:** PO-MARKER-7F3A  
**Epic Name:** Customer onboarding and first-success dashboard  
**Business Goal:** Reduce time-to-first-value for new administrators and power users

---

## Epic Overview

This epic focuses on creating a streamlined onboarding experience that guides new users through essential setup steps while providing visibility into progress and key metrics. The goal is to reduce confusion, accelerate time-to-value, and improve the overall user experience for all user types.

### Target Stakeholders

- **Admin users** - Need structured onboarding and progress tracking
- **Power users** - Need quick access to key metrics and KPIs
- **New users** - Need accessible, guided onboarding with helpful context

---

## Story Dependencies Map

ONB-101 (Welcome checklist) 
    |
    +---> ONB-104 (Export progress PDF) [depends on checklist data]

ONB-102 (Dashboard metrics) - Independent

ONB-103 (Keyboard navigation) - Independent

ONB-105 (Help tooltips) - Independent

### Dependency Details

| Story ID | Depends On | Reason |
|----------|------------|--------|
| ONB-101 | None | Foundation story - no dependencies |
| ONB-102 | None | Independent dashboard feature |
| ONB-103 | None | Independent accessibility feature |
| ONB-104 | ONB-101 | Export requires progress data from checklist |
| ONB-105 | None | Independent UI enhancement |

---

## Story Breakdown by Theme

### Theme 1: Guided Onboarding (High Priority)
**Goal:** Provide clear, actionable steps for new administrators

| Story | Points | Status |
|-------|--------|--------|
| ONB-101: Welcome checklist for new administrators | 5 | Committed |

### Theme 2: Visibility and Metrics (High Priority)
**Goal:** Enable quick access to important information

| Story | Points | Status |
|-------|--------|--------|
| ONB-102: Dashboard highlights with key metrics | 5 | Committed |

### Theme 3: Accessibility and UX (Medium Priority)
**Goal:** Ensure inclusive and intuitive user experience

| Story | Points | Status |
|-------|--------|--------|
| ONB-103: Keyboard-accessible onboarding navigation | 3 | Committed |
| ONB-105: Contextual help tooltips on setup screens | 2 | Committed |

