**Goal:** Enable stakeholders to review onboarding progress

| Story | Points | Status |
|-------|--------|--------|
| ONB-104: Export onboarding progress as PDF | 3 | Committed |

---

## Success Metrics

| Metric | Target | Measurement |
|--------|--------|-------------|
| Onboarding completion rate | >80% | % of new users completing checklist |
| Time to first dashboard view | <5 minutes | Average time from signup to dashboard |
| Support tickets related to setup | -50% | Month-over-month reduction |
| Accessibility compliance | WCAG 2.1 AA | Automated + manual testing |

---

## Acceptance Criteria for Epic Completion

- [ ] All committed stories completed and merged
- [ ] Onboarding checklist has at least 5 actionable items
- [ ] Dashboard displays at least 3 key metrics with trend indicators
- [ ] Full keyboard navigation support verified
- [ ] PDF export generates valid, readable documents
- [ ] All tooltips display relevant, accurate information
- [ ] Product Owner sign-off obtained

